      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ZIPPING CHEBET (1) is a sprinter who thrives over these shorter races. Was a bit beyond her last time when fourth (30.12) over 520m at Q Parklands in a Grade 5 but is better suited here over less ground. Hard to go past form at this journey, unbeaten in three runs. Boasts a strong record from this draw with three wins and two minor placings from five starts. Worth another chance. STOWAWAY (2) is better than last start when fourth (41.93) from Box 1 at Q Parklands over 710m. Boasts a strong record from this draw with five wins and three minor placings from 12 starts. Bold showing expected. AERATION (4) comes here following a speedy win over 366m at this track in 19.87. Has the ability and looks a key chance. HARA'S JACKSON (7) comes off a big run when finishing second in a dominant 19.72 last time. Has claims on that run.",
